---
title: Reservation State Machine
---
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Tentative : planner proposes a batch slice (shared pool, no stock held)
    Tentative --> Reserved : run approval reserves the batch quantity
    Tentative --> Released : plan not approved / order short -> slice dropped
    Reserved --> Issued : stock physically issued at dispatch (on-hand decreases)
    Reserved --> Released : order cancelled / rejected before dispatch -> free stock
    Issued --> [*]
    Released --> [*]
